                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "Heading",
                    "classes": [
                      "lp-h3"
                    ],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "String",
                        "text": "Privacy notice"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Paragraph",
                    "classes": [
                      "lp-copy"
                    ],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "String",
                        "text": "This notice covers the FOGGARA-DZ information and contact website, not a future operational application. Publisher: EURL SIREP OASES NEXUS WEFEH, Laghouat, Algeria. Privacy enquiries: kacimo2000@gmail.com."
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Paragraph",
                    "classes": [
                      "lp-copy"
                    ],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "String",
                        "text": "When you email us, we receive your email address, message and any name, role, organisation or project location you choose to provide. We use these to understand and answer your request and continue the discussion you initiated. Contact does not automatically subscribe you to marketing."
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Paragraph",
                    "classes": [
                      "lp-copy"
                    ],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "String",
                        "text": "Contact buttons open your email application; clicking alone does not submit a request. Webflow hosts the site and Gmail receives correspondence. These providers may process technical data or messages outside Algeria. We do not claim Algeria-only hosting."
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Paragraph",
                    "classes": [
                      "lp-copy"
                    ],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "String",
                        "text": "Correspondence is accessible as needed to handle the request. A project dossier is not shared with a potential partner without an appropriate arrangement with its owner. Retention is limited to the needs of the enquiry, follow-up and applicable legal obligations; you may request deletion of data no longer needed."
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Paragraph",
                    "classes": [
                      "lp-copy"
                    ],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "String",
                        "text": "Depending on your circumstances and applicable law, you may request information, access, correction, objection or deletion by email. Minimal identity verification may be necessary. You may contact Algeria’s ANPDP regarding your rights."
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Paragraph",
                    "classes": [
                      "lp-copy"
                    ],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "String",
                        "text": "Do not send health data, identity documents, banking details or technical secrets in your first message. Sensitive document exchange requires a separate arrangement. General reference: Law 18-07 as amended. This notice is not a compliance certification."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "Block",
                "classes": [
                  "lp-legalblock"
                ],
                "attributes": {
                  "id": "terms"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "Heading",
                    "classes": [
