                      {
                        "type": "String",
                        "text": "Terms of use"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Paragraph",
                    "classes": [
                      "lp-copy"
                    ],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "String",
                        "text": "The website describes the project, its architecture and intended services. A feature description does not guarantee that it is active or connected to live data. Service scope, price, timing and responsibilities are set out in a separate agreement."
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Paragraph",
                    "classes": [
                      "lp-copy"
                    ],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "String",
                        "text": "General information does not replace a field assessment or tailored professional advice. Do not use it as the sole basis for equipment operation or an investment decision. Intended benefits are not verified results or guaranteed returns."
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Paragraph",
                    "classes": [
                      "lp-copy"
                    ],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "String",
                        "text": "Misuse, unauthorised access attempts and unlawful submissions are prohibited. Content and trademarks remain the property of their respective owners. Mentioning a third party does not imply endorsement."
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Paragraph",
                    "classes": [
                      "lp-copy"
                    ],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "String",
                        "text": "Contact does not create a contract, exclusivity or a funding commitment. Confidentiality and document rights should be agreed before sensitive information is exchanged. Pages may change; contractual commitments remain governed by separate agreements."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "Block",
                "classes": [
